            "After general map-tuning, $\\mathcal{M}$ can be used for the general plug-and-play injection. Although the mapping network $\\mathcal{M}$ was not trained with any downstream model $\\mathcal{D}$ before, we can directly plug $\\mathcal{M}$ into each $\\mathcal{D}$.\n",
