            "\\textbf{Training Methods of Downstream Models.} We adopt BERT$_\\textrm{base}$~\\cite{BERT} as the backbone PLM in the experiments and consider four training methods for its adaptation to downstream tasks. Besides vanilla full-model fine-tuning, we also consider three parameter-efficient tuning (PET) methods, which have been becoming increasingly important in the era of large-scale PLMs~\\cite{DBLP:journals/corr/abs-2107-13586}. \n",
